    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d334">

                <pb facs="0275" n="266" sameAs="frus:frus1940v02/pg266"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">800.6176/153: Telegram</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Chargé in the United Kingdom</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic">Johnson</hi>) <hi
                        rendition="#italic">to the Secretary of State
                    </hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">London</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1940-02-20T16:00:00+00:00">February 20,
                            1940—4 p.m.</date>
                        <lb/> [Received February 20—12:55 p.m.]</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>423. The International Rubber Regulation Committee authorized 80 percent release
                    for the second quarter.</p>
                <p>It may be of use for future reference that Campbell privately informed the
                    Embassy after the meeting that in the absence of Hart, Bolderhay<anchor n="31"
                        xml:id="d334-f1"/> headed the Dutch delegation and advocated a 75 percent
                    release. He informed Campbell prior to the meeting that he would <pb facs="0276"
                        n="267" xml:id="pg267"/> do so and at Campbell’s request he agreed not to
                    vote against an 80 percent release if the other members of the Committee favored
                    it but he insisted on stating his point of view.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Johnson</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
    <standOff>
        <listAnnotation>
            <note corresp="#d334-f1" n="31" xml:id="d334-f1-content">
                <p>Member of the Netherland delegation on the International Rubber Regulation
                    Committee.</p>
            </note>
        </listAnnotation>
    </standOff>
